# Files excluded from `git archive`, which is what builds the release
# source tarball (.gitlab-ci.yml, package:source).
#
# The screenshots are ~2.6 MB and exist to explain kurono on the project
# page. A packager building from the tarball needs none of them, and
# they would be the largest thing in it by an order of magnitude. The
# README's image links therefore do not resolve inside the tarball --
# that is expected, and the project page is where the README is meant to
# be read.
assets/         export-ignore
.gitattributes  export-ignore
.gitlab-ci.yml  export-ignore
